9300424</span></a><span>] High CVE-2026-126855: Missing authorization in ImageCapture. </span><span>Reported by z3r0 on 2026-10-29</span></span><b><span><br></span></b><span><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/579313083\"><span>579313083</span></a><span>] High CVE-2026-126908: Type confusion in V8. </span><span>Reported by Google on 2026-10-29</span></span><b><span><br></span></b><span><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/579313193\"><span>579313193</span></a><span>] High CVE-2026-126849: Type confusion in V8. </span><span>Reported by Google on 2026-10-29</span></span><b><span><br></span></b><span><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/579818899\"><span>579818899</span></a><span>] High CVE-2026-126901: Use after free in PDF. </span><span>Reported by Vlad Stolyarov (Anthropic), assisted by Claude on 2026-10-30</span></span><b><span><br></span></b><span><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/580846651\"><span>580846651</span></a><span>] High CVE-2026-126852: Use after free in MediaStream. </span><span>Reported by Google on 2026-11-02</span></span><b><span><br></span></b><span><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/580853808\"><span>580853808</span></a><span>] High CVE-2026-126850: Incorrect authorization in SiteIsolation. </span><span>Reported by Google on 2026-11-02</span></span><b><span><br></span></b><span><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/580865537\"><span>580865537</span></a><span>] High CVE-2026-126841: Out of bounds read in Skia. </span><span>Reported by Google on 2026-11-02</span></span><b><span><br></span></b><span><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/580867480\"><span>580867480</span></a><span>] High CVE-2026-126902: Incorrect reference resolution in Browser. </span><span>Reported by Google on 2026-11-02</span></span><b><span><br></span></b><span><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/580867734\"><span>580867734</span></a><span>] High CVE-2026-126868: Type confusion in V8. </span><span>Reported by Google on 2026-11-02</span></span><b><span><br></span></b><span><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/580869107\"><span>580869107</span></a><span>] High CVE-2026-126921: Use after free in Accessibility. </span><span>Reported by Google on 2026-11-02</span></span><b><span><br></span></b><span><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/580875215\"><span>580875215</span></a><span>] High CVE-2026-126913: Out of bounds read in Compositing. </span><span>Reported by Google on 2026-11-02</span></span><b><span><br></span></b><span><span>[TBD][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/581629247\"><span>581629247</span></a><span>] High CVE-2026-126890: Out of bounds read in Media. </span><span>Reported by Vikas Anil Sharma - ( Agilehunt.com - Guarding your innovation ) on 2026-11-04</span></span><b><span><br></span></b><span><span>[TBD][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/581785712\"><span>581785712</span></a><span>] High CVE-2026-126860: Incorrect authorization in FileSystem. </span><span>Reported by tmemabo1 on 2026-11-04</span></span><b><span><br></span></b><span><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/581903854\"><span>581903854</span></a><span>] High CVE-2026-126920: Information leak in Skia. </span><span>Reported by Google on 2026-11-04</span></span><b><span><br></span></b><span><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/583122799\"><span>583122799</span></a><span>] High CVE-2026-126899: Use after free in Elements. </span><span>Reported by Google on 2026-11-07</span></span><b><span><br></span></b><span><span>We would also like to thank all security researchers that worked with us during the development cycle to prevent security bugs from ever reaching the stable channel.</span></span></p><p><span>Many of our security bugs are detected using </span><a href=\"https://code.google.com/p/address-sanitizer/wiki/AddressSanitizer\"><span>AddressSanitizer</span></a><span>, </span><a href=\"https://code.google.com/p/memory-sanitizer/wiki/MemorySanitizer\"><span>MemorySanitizer</span></a><span>, </span><a href=\"https://www.chromium.org/developers/testing/undefinedbehaviorsanitizer\"><span>UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer</span></a><span>, </span><a href=\"https://www.chromium.org/developers/testing/control-flow-integrity/\"><span>Control Flow Integrity</span></a><span>, </span><a href=\"https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/HEAD/testing/libfuzzer/README.md\"><span>libFuzzer</span></a><span>, or </span><a href=\"https://github.com/google/afl\"><span>AFL</span></a><span>.</span></p><p><span>Interested in switching release channels? Find out how </span><span><a href=\"https://www.chromium.org/getting-involved/dev-channel\">here</a><span>. If you find a new issue, please let us know by </span><a href=\"https://crbug.com/\">filing a bug</a><span>. The </span><a href=\"https://support.google.com/chrome/community\">community help forum</a><span> is also a great place to reach out for help or learn about common issues.</span></span></p><p><span><span>Srinivas Sista</span></span></p><p><span>Google Chrome</span></p>","zhKind","complete","补丁","漏洞","Google","http://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2026/11/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_01744469280.html","Chrome Releases",{"_80":81,"_82":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
